# mcpb/'s own build-time tooling - not runtime code, never belongs in the
# shipped bundle. This file is synced to mcpb/.mcpbignore (the pack root)
# by pack.ps1 step 3, so these paths are relative to mcpb/, not the repo root.
pack.ps1
verify_pack.py

# Editor / tooling backups (MCPB_PACKAGING_STANDARDS.md 2.4 - both patterns required)
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej